#: setup.php
msgid "Periodic Export Cycle"
msgstr "Wareegga Dhoofinta Xilliyeed"

#: setup.php
msgid "How often do you wish Cacti to Export Graphs.  This is the unit of Polling Cycles you wish to export Graphs."
msgstr "Intee jeer ayaad rabtaa in Cacti ay Dhoofiso Jaantusyada.  Tani waa halbeegga Wareegyada Xog-ururinta ee aad rabto inaad dhoofiso Jaantusyada."

#: setup.php
msgid "Every Polling Cycle"
msgstr "Wareeg kasta oo Xog-uruurin"

#: setup.php
#, php-format
msgid "Every %d Polling Cycles"
msgstr "%d Wareegyo Xog-uruurin kasta"

#: setup.php
msgid "Hourly at specified minutes"
msgstr "Saacad kasta daqiiqadaha la cayimay"

#: setup.php
msgid "If you want Cacti to export static images on an hourly basis, put the minutes of the hour when to do that. Cacti assumes that you run the data gathering script every 5 minutes, so it will round your value to the one closest to its runtime. For instance, 43 would equal 40 minutes past the hour."
msgstr "Haddii aad rabto in Cacti uu dhoofiyo sawirro taagan saacad kasta, geli daqiiqadaha saacadda marka la samaynayo taas. Cacti wuxuu u qaadanayaa inaad socodsiiso qoraalka (script) ururinta xogta 5-tii daqiiqoba mar, markaa wuxuu u soo dhoweyn doonaa qiimahaaga kan ugu dhow waqtiga uu shaqeeyo. Tusaale ahaan, 43 waxay u dhigmi doontaa 40 daqiiqo saacadda kadib."

#: setup.php
msgid "Daily at specified time"
msgstr "Maalin kasta waqtiga la cayimay"

#: setup.php
msgid "If you want Cacti to export static images on an daily basis, put here the time when to do that. Cacti assumes that you run the data gathering script every 5 minutes, so it will round your value to the one closest to its runtime. For instance, 21:23 would equal 20 minutes after 9 PM."
msgstr "Haddii aad rabto in Cacti uu dhoofiyo sawirro taagan maalin kasta, halkan geli waqtiga la samaynayo taas. Cacti wuxuu u qaadanayaa inaad socodsiiso qoraalka (script) ururinta xogta 5-tii daqiiqoba mar, markaa wuxuu u soo dhoweyn doonaa qiimahaaga kan ugu dhow waqtiga uu shaqeeyo. Tusaale ahaan, 21:23 waxay u dhigmi doontaa 20 daqiiqo kadib 9 PM."

#: setup.php
msgid "Use x Threads"
msgstr "Isticmaal x Threads"

#: setup.php
msgid "How many background threads do you wish Cacti to use when exporting graphs.  Default is 0 to run all export in poller thread, 1 or more to spawn separate background threads"
msgstr "Immisa dun-shaqo oo gadaal ah ayaad rabtaa in Cacti ay isticmaasho marka ay dhoofinayso jaantusyada. Qiimaha caadiga ahi waa 0 si dhammaan dhoofinta loogu socodsiiyo dunta xog-uruuriyaha, 1 ama ka badan si loo abuuro duno-shaqo oo gadaal ah oo gooni ah"

#: setup.php
msgid "Graph Selection & Settings"
msgstr "Xulashada Garaafka & Dejinta"

#: setup.php
msgid "The user name to utilize for establishing permissions to Cacti Graphs.  This user name will be used to determine which Graphs/Trees can be exported.  N/A means don't assume any security is in place."
msgstr "Magaca isticmaalaha loo adeegsanayo dejinta rukhsadaha Jaantusyada Cacti. Magacan isticmaale waxaa loo adeegsan doonaa si loo go'aamiyo Jaantusyada/Geedaha la dhoofin karo. N/A waxay ka dhigan tahay ha u qaadan in wax amni ah jiro."

#: setup.php
msgid "The Tree(s) to export."
msgstr "Geedka/Geedaha la dhoofinayo."

#: setup.php
msgid "Expand Devices/Sites"
msgstr "Ballaadhi Aaladaha/Goobaha"

#: setup.php
msgid "This setting determines if Tree Devices and Site Templates and Devices will be expanded or not.  If set to expanded, each host will have a sub-folder containing either Graph Templates or Data Query items."
msgstr "Dejintani waxay go'aamisaa in Aaladaha Geedka iyo Qaab-dhismeedyada Goobta iyo Aaladaha la ballaarin doono iyo in kale. Haddii loo dejiyo la ballaariyay, martigeliye kastaa wuxuu yeelan doonaa gal-hoosaad ka kooban Qaab-dhismeedyada Garaafka ama waxyaabaha Waydiinta Xogta."

