msgstr "Calaamadee tan haddii aad rabto habka sawirrada yar yar ee dhoofinta."

#: setup.php
msgid "Clear Directory"
msgstr "Nadiifi Galka"

#: setup.php
msgid "Check this Checkbox if you wish this Graph Export to clear the final directory before populating."
msgstr "Calaamadee sanduuqan haddii aad rabto in Dhoofinta Garaafka ay nadiifiso galka u dambeeya ka hor inta aan la buuxin."

#: setup.php
msgid "Export Directory"
msgstr "Galka Dhoofinta"

#: setup.php
msgid "This is the directory, either on the local system or on the remote system, that will contain the exported data."
msgstr "Kani waa galka, ha ahaado nidaamka maxalliga ah ama nidaamka fog, kaas oo ka koobnaan doona xogta la dhoofiyay."

#: setup.php
msgid "Local Scratch Directory"
msgstr "Galka Ku-meelgaarka ah ee Maxalliga ah"

#: setup.php
msgid "This is the directory that Cacti will temporarily store output prior to sending to the remote site via the transfer method.  The contents of this directory will be deleted after the data is transferred."
msgstr "Kani waa galka ay Cacti si ku meel gaar ah ugu keydin doonto wax-soo-saarka ka hor inta aan loo dirin goobta fog iyadoo loo marayo habka wareejinta. Waxa ku jira galkan waa la tirtiri doonaa ka dib marka xogta la wareejiyo."

#: setup.php
msgid "Remote Options"
msgstr "Ikhtiyaarrada Fog"

#: setup.php
msgid "Sanitize remote directory"
msgstr "Nadiifi galka fog"

#: setup.php
msgid "Check this if you want to delete any existing files in the FTP remote directory. This option is in use only when using the PHP built-in ftp functions."
msgstr "Calaamadee tan haddii aad rabto in aad tirtirto fayl kasta oo jira oo ku yaal galka fog ee FTP. Ikhtiyaarkan waxaa la adeegsadaa oo keliya marka la isticmaalayo hawlaha ftp ee ku dhex dhisan PHP."

#: setup.php
msgid "Remote Host"
msgstr "Martigeliyaha Fog"

#: setup.php
msgid "Denotes the host to send Exported Graphs to."
msgstr "Waxay tilmaamaysaa martigeliyaha loo dirayo Jaantusyada La Dhoofiyay."

#: setup.php
msgid "Remote Port"
msgstr "Dekedda Fog"

#: setup.php
msgid "Communication port to use for the export method if non-standard (leave empty for defaults)."
msgstr "Dekadda isgaarsiinta ee loo isticmaalo habka dhoofinta haddii aysan ahayn mid caadi ah (bannaanka u daa si loo isticmaalo kuwa caadiga ah)."

#: setup.php
msgid "Use passive mode"
msgstr "Isticmaal habka dadban (passive)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Check this if you want to connect in passive mode to the FTP server."
msgstr "Calaamadee tan haddii aad rabto in aad habka dadban (passive mode) ugu xiranto server-ka FTP."

#: setup.php
msgid "User"
msgstr "Isticmaale"

#: setup.php
msgid "Account to logon on the remote server (leave empty for defaults)."
msgstr "Akoonka lagu galayo serferka fog (ka tag isagoo madhan wixii caadi ah)."

#: setup.php
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Erayga sirta ah"

#: setup.php
msgid "Password for the remote ftp account (leave empty for blank)."
msgstr "Erayga sirta ah ee akoonka ftp ee fog (ka tag meel bannaan haddii aan la rabin)."

#: setup.php
msgid "Private Key Path"
msgstr "Jidka Furaha Gaarka ah"

#: setup.php
msgid "For SCP and RSYNC, enter the Private Key path if required."
msgstr "SCP iyo RSYNC, geli dariiqa Furaha Gaarka ah haddii loo baahdo."

#: setup.php
msgid "Exported Cacti Graph Pages"
msgstr "Boggaga Garaafka Cacti ee la Dhoofiyay"

#: setup.php
msgid "(Edit)"
msgstr "(Wax ka beddel)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Actions"
msgstr "Ficillada"

